From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tessera <development@tessera.local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:23:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Backport Paper main runtime fixes and post effects API

Paper commits a22040d, 6db70e0, 0c803ba, 18f05bb, e1f150a, beac08f, d5cc7d4, 217fb92, f8a210f and dd9d103. Integrate memory cleanup into the existing vanilla DFU bridge and preserve budgeted suggestions.

